WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.827 --> 00:00:19.268
Lara and Mom walked along a canal.

2
00:00:22.709 --> 00:00:25.330
Mom read aloud from her Venice guidebook.

3
00:00:26.091 --> 00:00:28.572
But Lara was too excited to listen.

4
00:00:36.652 --> 00:00:39.214
"This is the Rialto Bridge," read Mom.

5
00:00:39.234 --> 00:00:45.358
"It is the oldest bridge on the Grand Canal and—" "Ooh!"

6
00:00:45.818 --> 00:00:46.699
Lara squealed.

7
00:00:47.639 --> 00:00:50.161
She pointed to a row of black boats.

8
00:00:50.181 --> 00:00:55.084
"Mom, can we take a gondola ride?"

9
00:00:55.104 --> 00:00:58.026
"Good idea," said Mom.

10
00:00:58.046 --> 00:01:00.628
"My feet are getting sore."

11
00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.471
Mom hired a gondola to go to St.

12
00:01:05.531 --> 00:01:06.312
Mark's Square.

13
00:01:07.132 --> 00:01:10.034
Marco, the driver, helped them into the boat.

14
00:01:13.136 --> 00:01:16.618
Lara and Mom sat down on the pretty red cushions.

15
00:01:22.242 --> 00:01:25.684
Marco gestured with one arm and rowed with the other.

16
00:01:25.704 --> 00:01:28.406
"This is the Grand Canal.

17
00:01:29.747 --> 00:01:33.109
It's one of the major waterways in Venice," he said.

18
00:01:33.129 --> 00:01:36.872
"It's almost four kilometers long.

19
00:01:37.412 --> 00:01:40.014
And it's ninety meters wide in some places.

20
00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:45.597
There are 177 canals in Venice."

21
00:01:47.778 --> 00:01:49.619
A long motorboat passed by.

22
00:01:53.382 --> 00:01:54.582
looks like a bus!"

23
00:01:55.123 --> 00:01:55.783
said Lara.

24
00:01:55.803 --> 00:01:59.285
"That's a water bus," said Marco.

25
00:01:59.305 --> 00:02:01.726
"We don't have cars in Venice.

26
00:02:02.767 --> 00:02:04.168
So people have to walk.

27
00:02:05.856 --> 00:02:07.457
Or they travel on the canals.

28
00:02:08.258 --> 00:02:11.139
We have water buses and even water taxis!"

29
00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:13.901
He pointed to a smaller motorboat.

30
00:02:17.623 --> 00:02:20.685
Marco steered the gondola into a narrow canal.

31
00:02:25.368 --> 00:02:28.450
less traffic in this canal," Lara said.

32
00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:32.212
She stared up at the tall, elegant buildings.

33
00:02:35.292 --> 00:02:39.535
"Venice was a rich and powerful city during the Renaissance," Marco said.

34
00:02:39.555 --> 00:02:44.458
"People built palace-like houses to show off their wealth."

35
00:02:46.159 --> 00:02:48.601
They passed under a covered white bridge.

36
00:02:48.621 --> 00:02:53.564
"The Doge’s Palace is on the right," Marco said.

37
00:02:54.825 --> 00:02:56.706
It was a beautiful white building.

38
00:02:59.648 --> 00:03:01.189
Lara wrinkled her nose.

39
00:03:01.209 --> 00:03:04.011
"What's a doge?"

40
00:03:04.491 --> 00:03:05.092
she asked.

41
00:03:06.228 --> 00:03:09.370
"The doge was the ruler of Venice," Marco said.

42
00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:12.412
"The palace is a museum now."

43
00:03:13.553 --> 00:03:18.497
At the end of the canal, Marco turned the gondola into an open lagoon.

44
00:03:24.021 --> 00:03:25.662
we are," announced Marco.

45
00:03:25.682 --> 00:03:27.283
"This is St.

46
00:03:27.323 --> 00:03:28.103
Mark's Square!"

47
00:03:31.286 --> 00:03:34.328
Marco helped Mom and Lara out of the gondola.

48
00:03:35.628 --> 00:03:38.269
"Can we go see the Doge's Palace, Mom?"

49
00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:39.310
asked Lara.

50
00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.331
"Be sure to see St.

51
00:03:41.391 --> 00:03:43.632
Mark's Church and the bell tower too!"

52
00:03:44.012 --> 00:03:44.733
Marco said.

53
00:03:44.753 --> 00:03:47.394
"Thank you," said Mom.

54
00:03:48.095 --> 00:03:49.195
She turned to Lara.

55
00:03:49.215 --> 00:03:51.936
"My feet feel rested now.

56
00:03:52.457 --> 00:03:54.378
I'm ready for more sightseeing."

57
00:03:55.438 --> 00:03:56.279
Lara cheered.

58
00:03:56.299 --> 00:03:58.260
"Good! Let's go!"
